From 042a850ef93cd1a8c0672cd945fe1b8faa82b90b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 14:31:03 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Courier Station and Undercroft doctrines; the Undercroft
 panel

- Undercroft panel: the first player-facing espionage surface (informants
  and their verbs, held secrets, the Concord market), floatable from the
  building; the Undercroft is now a door on the campus
- Undercroft T3: Silent Floor (Assassination, -1 Marked per contract) or
  Whisper Market (sell a held secret to a rival court for gold and regard;
  the source court grows warier)
- Courier T3: Spy Network (+2 informants; every informant charts its court)
  or Trade Routes (caravans home from every held anchor pay by length each
  moon, the four best; seeded raids by length)
- Turning a secret into an informant now spends the secret
- Courier T3 parley text matches the 2 Connections cards it grants

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RF7HNp6pvyXiAz229q52Px
